Purpose: Help new trainees learn about RAM processes and procedures.

Goals: Provide training materials, quizzes, and resources to aid in the on-boarding process.

Key Features:

Training Modules: Interactive lessons and tutorials.
Quizzes and Assessments: Evaluate understanding of the material.
Documentation: Access to manuals, guides, and procedures.
Progress Tracking: Monitor trainee progress and completion.

Design: 

Homepage: Introduction to the onboarding process.
Modules Page: List of training modules and resources.
Quizzes Page: Access to quizzes and assessments.
Documentation Page: Manuals, guides, and procedural documents.
Dashboard: Progress tracking and user management.

Technology Stack:

MySQL: MySQL Database

Express.js: Web Application Framework for Node.js

React: Front-end Library

Node.js: JavaScript Runtime